    'level_normalized: Reconcile title_level and jd_implied_level THROUGH the company\'s leveling regime into the single real market level used for scoring (one of the same level values). Big-tech (Google/Meta/Amazon/AWS/Adobe/Microsoft/etc.) DEFLATE titles — a "Senior PM" there often carries Staff scope; map up. Early/mid startups (<~100 people) INFLATE — a "Head"/"Director" is often Senior-PM scope; map down. Banks use the VP-IC band above. When title and scope diverge, trust the company-normalized scope.',
